pan></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_medium family_pixel\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"The Lost Colony: Legacy Web Prototype\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3OTIzODc0LnBuZw==/original/qpAf0D.png\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">The Lost Colony: Legacy Web Prototype</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_9552288\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_7629332\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div style=\"width: 432px; height: 768px\" data-width=\"432\" class=\"game_frame game_loaded\" data-height=\"768\"><iframe src=\"https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18124761/index.html?v=1782642556\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share\" scrolling=\"no\" id=\"game_drop\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowtransparency=\"true\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"true\" mozallowfullscreen=\"true\" msallowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p></p><p><strong>The Lost Colony</strong> is a text-based colony survival game where every decision can shape the fate of your settlement.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Lead a group of human survivors stranded on an unknown and hostile planet. Manage limited resources, expand your colony, upgrade essential structures, and face unpredictable events that may help your people survive&mdash;or bring the entire settlement to ruin.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>This browser-based prototype was the original project that eventually evolved into the current version of <strong>The Lost Colony</strong>, now being rebuilt in Godot with expanded systems, a new interface, and a new visual direction.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Version</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Legacy MVP Alpha</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Features in this build</h2>\r\n<ul><li>Browser-based gameplay\r\n</li><li>Resource and population management\r\n</li><li>Colony structures and upgrades\r\n</li><li>Random events with lasting consequences\r\n</li><li>Early science-fiction lore and atmosphere\r\n</li><li>Multiple decisions that affect the colony\u2019s survival\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p>This is an early and discontinued prototype preserved as part of the project\u2019s development history. Bugs, incomplete systems, and balance issues should be expected.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Feedback is still welcome, especially from players interested in seeing how <strong>The Lost Colony</strong> began.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_6237823\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/prototypes\">Prototype</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Publisher</td><td>Studio Squirrel in Space</td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 5 total ratings\" tabindex=\