-in-space\">Studio Squirrel in Space</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-29 10:30:51\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16434489\">65 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>Thank you so much! I\u2019m really glad you enjoyed it. New updates with more events are already planned, and feedback like this helps a lot with development.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_replies has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16369175\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:12721668,&quot;id&quot;:16369175}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/themastergear\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog-gold.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/themastergear\">themastergear</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-26 04:31:17\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16369175\">68 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>Reminds me at a glance of Outpost 1.5. A game I was obsessed with as child, and only beat later if life without cheating. While Frostpunk is a lot different than these games, I do like one thing from Outpost 1.5, and that&#x27;s the newspaper that comes out that explains the events in game. Another theme I like about it also was the NASA seriousness with finding a planet at the start of the game feels very grim with out poor your chances are at finding life. It makes the feel of finding life hopeless and makes it feel like you&#x27;re going off to your own doom without any escape. This form of horror is really rare, and I don&#x27;t get from most games or even books.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post_replies top_level_replies\"><div class=\"community_post is_reply has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16372965\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:17910216,&quot;id&quot;:16372965}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/studio-squirrel-in-space\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/studio-squirrel-in-space\">Studio Squirrel in Space</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-26 18:40:27\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16372965\">68 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>Thank you so much for this comment!</p><p>I didn\u2019t know Outpost 1.5 before reading this, so I went after it and now I really want to play it properly. The atmosphere you described &mdash; the NASA-like seriousness, the hopelessness, and the feeling that the mission might already be doomed &mdash; sounds exactly like the kind of sci-fi survival tension I love.</p><p>When I manage to finish it without cheating, I\u2019ll definitely come back and let you know. :)</p><p>Also, if you had the chance to play The Lost Colony, I\u2019d really love to hear what you thought. Did it create any survival tension for you? Was the objective clear? And what improvements would you suggest &mdash; more events, better writing, clearer consequences, stronger atmosphere, or something else?</p><p>Thanks again. Your comment genuinely gave me something new to discover.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_replies has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16316934\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:10910945,&quot;id&quot;:16316934}\"><div id=\"last-post\" class=\"post_anchor\"></div><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost-colony-prototype\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/matheqs\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/matheqs\">Matheqs</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-18 23:10:04\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16316934\">76 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>Amazing game, specially for the lore. I had a lot of fun with this one!</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstudio-squirrel-in-space.itch.io%2Fthe-lost